n<br><br>Sum of numbers divisible by\n7 or 13 = Sum of no. divisible by\n7 + sum of the no. divisible by 13 – Sum of the\nnumbers divisible by 7 and 13\n<br><br> = 2107 + 1196 - 182\n<br><br>= 3121"
